OL,3,GNEWSAUproar over housing plans for
OL,4,A'Dales gateway'
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents of a village on the edge of
OL,7,Fthe Yorkshire Dales have described
OL,8,Fplans for a new housing development as
OL,9,Fa "land grab" that would hinder its
OL,10,Fheritage and natural beauty.
OL,12,FDeveloper Chartford Homes has submitted
OL,13,Fa planning application to Bradford
OL,14,FCouncil for 55 homes on a 3.12-hectare
OL,15,Fgreen-belt site in Addingham.
OL,23,APub: 16-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,382,380,200,160,0,100
