OL,3,GNEWSAUproar over housing plans for
OL,4,A'Dales gateway'
OL,5,
OL,6,FDistrict councillors, parish
OL,7,Fcouncillors and residents opposing the
OL,8,Fdevelopment say the plans would
OL,9,Fencourage "urban sprawl", with more
OL,10,Fthan 160 attending an extraordinary
OL,11,Fparish council meeting about the
OL,12,Fproposals on Monday.
OL,14,FBradford councillor Jane Sellers says
OL,15,Fresidents are "very shocked" and there
OL,16,Fhas been no formal consultation.
